casebook c-46cfr-63_15-7-and-63_25-1-boiler-draft v1
source "C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "when a flame safety system shutdown occurs"
observe flame_shutdown "a flame safety system shutdown has occurred"

# manual: "operation of the lower low water cutoff"
observe lower_low_water_cutoff_operated "the lower low water cutoff of a steam boiler has operated"

# manual: "which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated"
observe low_water_cutoff_active "the low water cutoff of a small automatic auxiliary boiler has activated"

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
observe prepurge_done "the prepurge period has been completed"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe start_requested "a start of the boiler has been requested, so ignition is called for"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe fuel_valve_open "the fuel oil valve is opening or open"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe ignition_on "ignition has occurred"

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
claim flame_shutdown_alarm "flame safety system shutdown requires audible alarm and visible indicator" severity 6 needs flame_shutdown

# manual: "For steam boilers, operation of the lower low water cutoff must automatically sound an audible alarm."
claim low_water_alarm "lower low water cutoff operation requires audible alarm and visual indicator" severity 7 needs lower_low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
claim lwco_indicator_needed "low water cutoff activation must be visually indicated" severity 5 needs low_water_cutoff_active

# manual: "A visual indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by low water."
claim low_water_indicator "a visual indicator must show that the shutdown was caused by low water" severity 5 needs lower_low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "A visible indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by the flame safety system."
claim flame_shutdown_indicator "a visible indicator must show that the shutdown was caused by the flame safety system" severity 5 needs flame_shutdown

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
claim fuel_before_ignition "fuel oil valve opening without ignition having occurred first or at the same time" severity 6 needs fuel_valve_open

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
claim start_too_soon "a start has been requested but the required prepurge period has not been completed" severity 5 needs start_requested

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
prepurge_done rebuts start_too_soon

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
ignition_on rebuts fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
action hold_start when any start_too_soon

# manual: "The visible indicators must require manual reset."
action keep_running idle

# manual: "A visible indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by the flame safety system."
action shut_down_boiler safe when any flame_shutdown_alarm low_water_alarm

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
action hold_fuel_valve when any fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
action raise_alarm when any lwco_indicator_needed low_water_indicator flame_shutdown_indicator

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
prefer shut_down_boiler over hold_fuel_valve over hold_start over raise_alarm over keep_running
